            {
              "value": "[[100*m*m]]",
              "why": "That is the middle squared. Take away $[[b]]^2$."
            }
          ]
        },
        "hints": [
          "What number is in the middle?",
          "Square the middle, take away the distance squared."
        ],
        "solution": "Middle $[[10*m]]$, distance $[[b]]$: $[[100*m*m]] - [[b*b]] = [[100*m*m-b*b]]$.",
        "skill": "dos-around",
        "difficulty": 1,
        "compute": "(10*m-b)*(10*m+b)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "m": {
              "from": 2,
              "to": 9
            },
            "b": {
              "from": 1,
              "to": 4
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hundred",
        "prompt": "Work out $[[100-b]] \\times [[100+b]]$.",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[10000 - b*b]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": ["The middle is $100$."],
        "solution": "$100^2 - [[b]]^2 = 10000 - [[b*b]] = [[10000-b*b]]$.",
        "skill": "dos-around",
        "difficulty": 2,
        "compute": "(100-b)*(100+b)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "b": {
              "from": 1,
              "to": 9
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "middle",
        "prompt": "$[[10*m-b]] \\times [[10*m+b]] = \\square^2 - [[b]]^2$. Which number goes in the box?",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[10*m]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": ["The middle is half of the two numbers added."],
        "solution": "The middle is half the sum: $[[20*m]] \\div 2 = [[10*m]]$.",
        "skill": "dos-around",
        "difficulty": 2,
        "compute": "((10*m-b)+(10*m+b))/2",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "m": {
              "from": 2,
              "to": 9
            },
            "b": {
              "from": 1,
              "to": 9
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "fives",
        "prompt": "Work out $[[10*m+5-b]] \\times [[10*m+5+b]]$.",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
          "accepted": ["[[(10*m+5)^2 - b*b]]"],
          "form": "any"
        },
        "hints": [
          "The middle ends in $5$: square it with the Unit 12 pattern.",
          "Take away $[[b]]^2$."
        ],
        "solution": "Middle $[[10*m+5]]$, and $[[10*m+5]]^2 = [[(10*m+5)^2]]$. Take away $[[b*b]]$: $[[(10*m+5)^2-b*b]]$.",
        "skill": "dos-around",
        "difficulty": 3,
        "compute": "(10*m+5-b)*(10*m+5+b)",
        "template": {
          "vars": {
            "m": {
              "from": 2,
              "to": 9
            },
            "b": {
              "from": 1,
              "to": 4
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "hall",
        "prompt": "A hall has $[[10*m-b]]$ rows of $[[10*m+b]]$ seats. How many seats is that?",
        "answer": {
          "kind": "value",
